WEBVTT

00:11.043 --> 00:13.751
[fire crackling]

00:30.501 --> 00:33.209
[theme music playing]

00:38.126 --> 00:39.334
[clanking]

00:41.751 --> 00:43.751
[wind whooshing]

00:48.793 --> 00:50.793
[music continues]

01:12.459 --> 01:14.459
[wind whooshing vigorously]

01:21.126 --> 01:23.459
[heroic music playing]

01:24.459 --> 01:26.834
[clanking]

01:32.418 --> 01:33.959
[hissing]

01:42.959 --> 01:44.376
[music ends]

01:48.876 --> 01:51.168
[wind howling]

02:06.209 --> 02:08.459
[humming]

02:08.543 --> 02:10.084
Ringo! Ugh.

02:10.668 --> 02:12.376
Customer. Big hat.

02:20.543 --> 02:22.334
Welcome, sir. I'll bring you some tea.

02:22.418 --> 02:24.709
It's not good tea,
but it's hot, and you're frozen,

02:24.793 --> 02:27.709
and I'll bring you a rag
because when I'm frozen, my snot drips.

02:27.793 --> 02:30.334
Then a nice big soba.
We make the best soba.

02:30.418 --> 02:32.793
Honest. Bad tea, great soba. Okay?

02:35.876 --> 02:37.793
[Ringo humming]

02:42.501 --> 02:45.376
Stumpy! More noodles, fast.

02:46.793 --> 02:48.334
Finish your bowls.

02:48.418 --> 02:51.084
I paid your fathers good money for you.

02:51.168 --> 02:52.959
The brothels will pay me even more

02:53.043 --> 02:56.668
once you get some curve on,
you skinny country nothings. Eat!

02:57.251 --> 03:00.543
[Ringo humming]

03:05.834 --> 03:07.293
-[shop owner] Go! Hurry!
-Huh?

03:07.376 --> 03:10.584
If that flesh-trader kills anyone here,
it'd be bad for business.

03:12.876 --> 03:14.001
Go and don't spill!

03:20.501 --> 03:22.251
[sniffing]

03:23.959 --> 03:25.251
[slurping]

03:30.126 --> 03:31.126
It's good, right?

03:33.918 --> 03:35.293
[breathes deeply] Ah.

03:36.043 --> 03:38.043
[Ringo humming]

03:40.584 --> 03:41.584
Finally!

03:41.668 --> 03:44.084
Eat up, girls. Eat it all!

03:44.168 --> 03:46.793
-[Ringo] Oh.
-[grunts, growls]

03:47.751 --> 03:50.168
What are you? A dog?

03:50.251 --> 03:51.959
You let a dog serve food!

03:52.043 --> 03:56.709
[laughing nervously] Forgive my son.
Can't go a day without breaking dishes.

03:56.793 --> 03:58.126
Ringo, clean him!

03:58.209 --> 03:59.043
I'm sorry.

03:59.959 --> 04:01.376
-[Ringo] Ah!
-Argh!

04:03.584 --> 04:05.501
-[whimpers] Sorry, sorry.
-[growls]

04:06.001 --> 04:09.751
[tense music accelerates, ends]

04:10.668 --> 04:12.334
-[man gasps]
-[woman whimpers]

04:13.834 --> 04:15.834
[long sighs]

04:15.918 --> 04:18.876
I should put down this lame dog.

04:21.334 --> 04:22.293
I'm not a dog.

04:22.793 --> 04:26.209
Did you just bark? [chuckles]

04:26.793 --> 04:28.793
Do you know who I am?

04:28.876 --> 04:32.751
I am Hachiman the Flesh-Trader.

04:32.834 --> 04:36.168
No one messes with Hachi!

04:38.418 --> 04:42.293
[long scraping]

04:56.418 --> 04:58.793
Hmm. Impressive.

04:59.543 --> 05:01.251
I've never seen a gun like it.

05:02.293 --> 05:05.501
Front loading, not a Japanese pistol.

05:07.918 --> 05:09.626
A European design, isn't it?

05:09.709 --> 05:10.918
[gun clicks]

05:11.001 --> 05:14.251
-[ominous music playing]
-Ugh!

05:14.334 --> 05:17.293
That would make it illegal.

05:17.376 --> 05:19.459
[samurai] Hachiman the Flesh-Trader.

05:19.543 --> 05:22.001
Of course, I've heard of you.

05:22.709 --> 05:25.293
Never leaves a village
without buying one of its daughters.

05:25.376 --> 05:26.209
[whimpers]

05:26.293 --> 05:28.918
You must have important friends
to own a weapon like that.

05:29.918 --> 05:32.793
Why do you know so much about Hachi?

05:32.876 --> 05:34.793
Maybe I've been following you.

05:35.709 --> 05:40.543
The famous Hachi
with the famous gun. [chuckles]

05:41.584 --> 05:43.084
I'd love a gun like that.

05:44.043 --> 05:46.001
You can tell me who sold it to you.

05:48.084 --> 05:50.626
Hmm. Fuck off.

05:52.168 --> 05:55.459
You will tell me who sold you that gun.

05:55.543 --> 05:57.084
-[suspenseful music]
-[clicks]

06:01.668 --> 06:05.918
You put my bullet against your blade?

06:07.418 --> 06:09.084
You don't deserve my blade.

06:09.668 --> 06:11.668
You don't even deserve this blade.

06:14.459 --> 06:15.834
[suspenseful music playing]

06:21.043 --> 06:22.459
[screams]

06:22.543 --> 06:23.376
[gasps]

06:23.459 --> 06:28.501
[wails, grunts]

06:29.543 --> 06:31.793
Take the gun if you want it! Take it!

06:31.876 --> 06:34.209
Ah! No! [grunts]

06:34.751 --> 06:38.209
It's a filthy gun from a filthy place.
I don't want it.

06:39.084 --> 06:41.709
-[Hachi grunts]
-I wanna know who sold it to you.

06:41.793 --> 06:43.043
Tell me now.

06:43.126 --> 06:47.459
[whimpers] Heiji Shindo.
I bought it from Heiji Shindo!

06:47.543 --> 06:50.251
-[tense music playing]
-Heiji Shindo.

06:51.334 --> 06:53.501
Where is Heiji Shindo?

06:53.584 --> 06:56.334
I don't know! I swear. [whimpers]

06:57.251 --> 06:59.334
[whimpers, gasps]

06:59.959 --> 07:00.834
[Hachi] Ah!

07:01.834 --> 07:06.001
[suspenseful music playing]

07:06.751 --> 07:08.001
[exhales]

07:09.126 --> 07:10.168
[Hachi grunts]

07:11.376 --> 07:15.293
You dead-eyed, half-blooded demon bastard.

07:15.376 --> 07:17.251
You look like an onryō.

07:22.959 --> 07:27.668
[Hachi screams, whimpers]

07:27.751 --> 07:30.626
[heavy breaths]

07:33.459 --> 07:34.584
[sighs]

07:38.293 --> 07:40.376
[wind whooshing]

07:40.459 --> 07:41.293
Hoo!

07:54.001 --> 07:57.084
[soft music playing]

08:00.209 --> 08:02.876
[clinking]

08:09.668 --> 08:13.584
[Ringo humming]

08:18.001 --> 08:22.543
[humming continues] Hm? [gasps]

08:24.376 --> 08:25.751
I found you!

08:25.834 --> 08:28.126
I'd never catch up on the path,
but I remember this shortcut

08:28.209 --> 08:30.709
'cause when we traveled
to the Izushi shrine for my 7th birthday,

08:30.793 --> 08:32.001
I went to pee and got lost,

08:32.084 --> 08:34.293
so I slept with a family
of tanuki for three days

08:34.376 --> 08:37.543
and ate leaves and scarabs, and got to
know the forest really, really well, so…

08:41.084 --> 08:42.084
Go home.

08:46.459 --> 08:47.834
I hate home!

08:49.584 --> 08:52.209
Please. My whole life,
I couldn't do anything right,

08:52.293 --> 08:54.668
but now I know what I'm supposed to do.

08:55.543 --> 08:58.251
Be a samurai, like you.

08:58.918 --> 09:02.459
Please. Let me be your apprentice.
Uh, I'll do anything.

09:05.709 --> 09:09.918
[sighs] A breeze can throw
a crane off course.

09:10.668 --> 09:13.793
You… are a typhoon.

09:24.543 --> 09:26.251
[footsteps approaching]

09:26.334 --> 09:28.709
Please! I'm strong.
I can carry your things,

09:28.793 --> 09:31.293
and you can have
the best soba in the world every day!

09:31.376 --> 09:34.043
And I'll do anything you ask… Master.

09:34.584 --> 09:37.251
Uh, anything so I can learn
to be just like you.

09:38.751 --> 09:39.626
Like me?

09:41.418 --> 09:44.459
You're deformed, but you're still strong.

09:52.959 --> 09:53.918
[grunts]

09:55.793 --> 09:57.876
[efforts, grunts]

09:59.293 --> 10:00.126
[sighs]

10:01.168 --> 10:04.626
[humming]

10:04.709 --> 10:06.334
[crow cawing]

10:06.418 --> 10:10.834
[footsteps receding]

10:34.418 --> 10:39.334
[theme music playing]

10:42.668 --> 10:45.043
[clanking]

10:57.001 --> 11:00.168
To a man lost in the dark,
an ember can light the way.

11:01.043 --> 11:03.209
Thank you for my ember.

11:04.084 --> 11:06.251
I was lost without course so long.

11:08.668 --> 11:09.584
Please.

11:10.168 --> 11:14.543
Let this ember's light brighten a path
from this Heiji Shindo to the men I seek.

11:17.001 --> 11:19.959
Please guide my steps until I find them.

11:21.709 --> 11:24.209
Please give me the strength to kill them.

11:26.876 --> 11:28.043
Or let me die.

11:32.834 --> 11:33.668
Please

11:34.876 --> 11:37.043
protect Swordfather from time and harm.

11:41.793 --> 11:48.751
[whooshing]

11:57.376 --> 11:58.251
[grunts]

12:00.918 --> 12:02.584
[ominous music playing]

12:11.126 --> 12:13.043
[music crescendos]

12:17.001 --> 12:20.543
[whooshing]

12:30.418 --> 12:31.251
Agh!

12:35.084 --> 12:36.209
[boy] You wanna go?

12:37.209 --> 12:38.251
Go ahead.

12:38.918 --> 12:40.751
Just jump.

12:48.084 --> 12:50.293
[thunder rumbling]

12:50.376 --> 12:51.959
You think you can fight us?

12:52.543 --> 12:53.793
An orphan?

12:53.876 --> 12:55.126
I know what you are.

12:55.626 --> 12:58.418
Your whore mother killed herself

12:58.501 --> 13:02.126
because your father is a white devil.

13:03.043 --> 13:05.876
[all laughing]

13:06.626 --> 13:09.293
[whooshing]

13:09.376 --> 13:11.209
[grunts]

13:12.501 --> 13:15.876
[kids grunting]

13:15.959 --> 13:17.918
[whooshing]

13:18.001 --> 13:19.418
[grunting]

13:25.251 --> 13:26.959
[thunder rumbling]

13:27.459 --> 13:28.626
Told you.

13:29.293 --> 13:30.501
Round eyes.

13:31.668 --> 13:33.084
Like a dog.

13:33.168 --> 13:34.626
[kids laughing]

13:37.251 --> 13:38.376
[grunts]

13:40.168 --> 13:41.168
[grunts]

13:41.251 --> 13:42.709
[pants]

13:43.709 --> 13:44.543
[groans]

13:44.626 --> 13:49.501
[tense music crescendos]

13:52.959 --> 13:54.584
[explodes]

13:59.918 --> 14:01.918
[hissing]

14:07.043 --> 14:10.918
[pants, whimpers]

14:12.709 --> 14:16.959
[coughs]

14:20.543 --> 14:22.543
[squeaking sound]

14:34.501 --> 14:39.376
[hissing]

14:45.418 --> 14:47.209
[clanking, chiming]

14:49.918 --> 14:52.793
Hmm. The heavens throw treasure.

14:55.459 --> 15:00.584
[efforts, grunts]

15:04.209 --> 15:06.459
[pants]

15:06.543 --> 15:08.709
-[Young samurai grunts]
-[pants]

15:10.168 --> 15:14.376
[both grunting, panting]

15:15.793 --> 15:20.168
[both panting]

15:24.418 --> 15:27.501
One, two, and--

16:00.834 --> 16:01.876
[The Swordmaker] Hmm.

16:02.751 --> 16:04.834
Take the bowl as you go. Thank you.

16:05.876 --> 16:07.626
[clanking, chiming]

16:11.293 --> 16:13.209
You did not go.

16:14.751 --> 16:17.209
Hmm. Have you somewhere to go?

16:20.751 --> 16:21.709
Yes.

16:22.334 --> 16:23.626
Well, go then.

16:23.709 --> 16:25.834
Now. Goodbye.

16:25.918 --> 16:29.876
[clanking, chiming]

16:35.418 --> 16:37.501
[thunder rumbling]

16:39.709 --> 16:44.459
[clanking]

16:53.293 --> 16:54.793
[long sigh]

16:55.376 --> 16:57.043
It's a strange metal.

17:14.959 --> 17:17.001
[thunder rumbling]

17:28.709 --> 17:30.459
[music crescendos, fades]

17:30.543 --> 17:33.334
-[clanking]
-[gasps]

17:48.168 --> 17:51.334
Hmm. Cold morning.

17:51.418 --> 17:54.126
It would be nice if someone made tea.

18:19.793 --> 18:20.626
Hmm.

18:21.418 --> 18:24.334
Would be nice if someone got my tongs.

18:26.209 --> 18:27.084
[clanging]

18:28.834 --> 18:30.626
The longer ones.

18:33.834 --> 18:35.959
[clanking]

18:37.543 --> 18:38.459
[The Swordmaker] Hmm.

18:38.959 --> 18:43.126
It would be nice
if somebody hammered out the impurities.

18:45.751 --> 18:48.001
[clanking]

18:51.501 --> 18:52.334
[grunts]

18:52.834 --> 18:56.209
Would be nice if someone kept proper time.

19:00.084 --> 19:01.543
[grunts]

19:11.834 --> 19:16.876
[soft music playing]

19:19.043 --> 19:20.876
[sighs]

19:22.918 --> 19:27.376
[theme music playing]

19:39.084 --> 19:40.543
[horse neighing]

19:40.626 --> 19:43.626
Come on, people. Keep it moving. Let's go.

19:46.626 --> 19:47.626
Next!

19:52.168 --> 19:53.959
This travel pass is invalid.

19:54.043 --> 19:55.668
[whispers] It's my husband's.

19:55.751 --> 19:57.626
[whispers] It's invalid without him.

19:58.209 --> 19:59.293
Next!

19:59.376 --> 20:03.209
He died. I make the baskets.
He only sold them.

20:04.001 --> 20:06.959
Please. Or I can't feed my children.

20:07.043 --> 20:10.543
[inspector] You know the rules.
Women can't travel without a chaperone.

20:10.626 --> 20:11.668
Next!

20:11.751 --> 20:14.751
[whimpers, sobs]

20:14.834 --> 20:16.168
Travel pass.

20:19.876 --> 20:22.126
-Next.
-[woman] Please! [sobs]

20:28.709 --> 20:33.834
[upbeat music playing]

20:34.834 --> 20:37.334
[indistinct chatter]

20:52.168 --> 20:54.918
Excuse me.
Would you perhaps be able to tell me whe--

20:55.543 --> 20:57.876
Excuse me. Could you help me find the--

20:58.376 --> 21:00.084
[horses neighing]

21:00.168 --> 21:01.376
Watch it, asshole.

21:02.418 --> 21:03.334
Apologies.

21:03.959 --> 21:07.584
I'm looking for something,
but Kyoto's very big. [sighs]

21:08.084 --> 21:10.293
Do you know
where I can find the Shindo Dojo?

21:10.376 --> 21:11.376
[samurai 2] Shindo?

21:12.001 --> 21:13.459
That's our dojo.

21:13.543 --> 21:14.834
You're gonna apply?

21:14.918 --> 21:16.876
You look like a blind beggar.

21:17.376 --> 21:18.959
[all laughing]

21:19.043 --> 21:23.293
[sighs] If you would please show me
how to find your dojo,

21:23.376 --> 21:24.834
I would be grateful.

21:25.751 --> 21:26.876
Sure.

21:26.959 --> 21:29.668
Follow the road to the shrine.
Once you go around the gates,

21:29.751 --> 21:31.876
you'll see the sign
across the puppet show.

21:32.376 --> 21:33.418
Good luck.

21:33.501 --> 21:34.793
-[horses neighing]
-Hyah!

21:34.876 --> 21:35.709
[laughing]

21:43.626 --> 21:44.793
[children laughing]

21:56.501 --> 21:58.251
[prostitutes laughing]

22:12.418 --> 22:15.834
You look lost, lost boy. Come on inside.

22:16.334 --> 22:17.334
Rest a while.

22:17.918 --> 22:19.959
I'm looking for the Shindo Dojo.

22:20.584 --> 22:23.001
-[old man grunts]
-[prostitutes laughing]

22:24.834 --> 22:27.793
Which… this I see is not.

22:27.876 --> 22:30.709
This is better. This is the Shindo House.

22:30.793 --> 22:34.418
If you wanna show off
your sword skills, you can do it here.

22:34.501 --> 22:36.709
We can polish the tip up for you.

22:36.793 --> 22:38.876
I must decline.

22:39.668 --> 22:41.043
My business is urgent.

22:41.126 --> 22:44.959
[gasps] Most men grab first,
ask prices later.

22:45.709 --> 22:47.293
You're different.

22:47.376 --> 22:50.209
Polite, sweet.

22:52.001 --> 22:52.959
But firm.

22:53.834 --> 22:56.793
Okay, lost boy.
Walk east to the Kamo River.

22:56.876 --> 22:59.501
Take the bridge to the temple
with the thousand creepy statues.

22:59.584 --> 23:01.043
It's on the hill just past.

23:03.043 --> 23:05.584
I wish you a successful day of business.

23:06.376 --> 23:08.501
[people groaning, booing]

23:09.584 --> 23:11.209
Uh-oh. Oh!

23:12.376 --> 23:13.209
[sighs]

23:14.501 --> 23:15.876
How much for one night?

23:19.001 --> 23:20.168
How much for three?

23:21.543 --> 23:22.751
[women giggling]

23:23.751 --> 23:25.084
[prostitute 1] It's all paid for.

23:25.584 --> 23:27.584
Just relax and enjoy.

23:29.084 --> 23:31.418
Have you ever been with a woman before?

23:33.251 --> 23:34.959
You just have to learn.

23:37.834 --> 23:41.418
[prostitute 1]
Round, firm, like a pumpkin.

23:41.501 --> 23:43.376
You can be a little rough with it.

23:44.501 --> 23:49.168
These, you have to be gentler,
soft like ripe peaches.

23:49.709 --> 23:51.209
You like peaches?

23:52.709 --> 23:54.001
Peaches.

24:03.876 --> 24:06.751
[town man] Make way.
Make way for Princess Akemi!

24:06.834 --> 24:08.584
Make way!

24:13.126 --> 24:19.293
[gentle music playing]

24:50.001 --> 24:51.168
[deep sigh]

24:51.959 --> 24:55.543
Father, I know your wisdom
is beyond reproach.

24:55.626 --> 24:57.834
I submit to your will wholeheartedly.

24:58.626 --> 25:01.876
I would be remiss
if I didn't speak my mind about my future.

25:06.376 --> 25:07.501
[breathes deeply]

25:08.751 --> 25:12.584
[regal music playing]

25:25.543 --> 25:27.084
[music fades]

25:37.418 --> 25:40.209
Did you talk to him, Seki? Tell me!

25:40.751 --> 25:41.959
Uh…

25:42.043 --> 25:45.959
I am well, Akemi-sama.
Thank you for asking.

25:46.043 --> 25:46.876
Hm.

25:48.001 --> 25:51.376
This morning, I made indelicate mention,

25:51.459 --> 25:54.084
and now he told me to fetch you.

25:55.626 --> 25:59.793
When you speak to him,
remember to lilt your voice.

25:59.876 --> 26:02.751
[scoffs] So, I should speak like a child.

26:03.251 --> 26:08.626
Or like a woman
who intends to get what she wants.

26:16.501 --> 26:19.334
Father, forgive my interrup--

26:20.126 --> 26:22.126
[child laughing]

26:22.209 --> 26:24.001
[Daichi laughs]

26:24.084 --> 26:27.918
Tomoe will make a great lord one day.
He does what he wants.

26:28.668 --> 26:30.293
[babbles]

26:30.376 --> 26:33.626
Right now, Tomoe wants a mess! [chuckles]

26:33.709 --> 26:35.668
But you, my pearl,

26:36.251 --> 26:38.126
you have a different duty, no?

26:38.959 --> 26:42.668
To create alliances by being
a pleasing wife to a great man.

26:43.834 --> 26:45.626
Now I'm told you believe

26:45.709 --> 26:48.584
you have an opinion
on who you might want to marry.

26:50.251 --> 26:51.084
[sighs]

26:51.918 --> 26:55.543
Father, I know your wisdom
is beyond reproach,

26:55.626 --> 26:58.793
and I submit to your will wholly,
but I would be remiss if--

26:58.876 --> 27:02.001
[Daichi] Do you know what happens
when you feed a pig sweets?

27:02.084 --> 27:03.668
Of course you don't.

27:03.751 --> 27:06.334
Your life has been robed in silk.

27:06.418 --> 27:09.001
You've never seen the mud of the sty.

27:09.084 --> 27:12.084
Your father wasn't a pig farmer like mine.

27:12.584 --> 27:14.584
When a farmer
feeds his pig too many sweets,

27:14.668 --> 27:17.459
its teeth rot. Its gums fester.

27:17.543 --> 27:19.334
The infection goes to its brain,

27:19.418 --> 27:22.751
and it must be slaughtered
before it reaches full size.

27:23.251 --> 27:26.834
The pig can't be blamed.
He's a pig and will eat all it can.

27:27.376 --> 27:29.501
The fault is with the farmer…

27:30.834 --> 27:31.876
who knows better.

27:32.876 --> 27:35.209
Am I a pig, Father?

27:35.709 --> 27:39.376
You want sugar
when there are proper options.

27:39.459 --> 27:42.501
More than a few lords
have taken notice of you and inquired.

27:42.584 --> 27:44.418
Ah! News came just this morning.

27:44.501 --> 27:48.126
Lord Saito's wife died in childbirth,
and he needs a new bride.

27:48.209 --> 27:51.793
[yelling] He's an old man!
And a drunk and a whoremonger!

27:51.876 --> 27:54.626
Lord Saito earns 100,000 koku!

27:55.626 --> 27:58.293
Is that your price for me?

28:01.334 --> 28:05.168
If I don't marry you off, you'll end up
in a brothel lying with him anyway.

28:05.251 --> 28:09.126
So would you rather be
his wife or his whore?

28:09.209 --> 28:12.209
[babbles]

28:25.626 --> 28:26.543
Father.

28:27.543 --> 28:30.334
I know your wisdom is beyond reproach,

28:30.418 --> 28:32.834
and I submit to your will wholeheartedly.

28:33.376 --> 28:36.626
I… I spoke from fear,
as these men live so far away,

28:36.709 --> 28:39.709
and I cannot imagine a life
without my father close.

28:40.501 --> 28:43.334
Please, consider someone who lives near.

28:43.418 --> 28:47.584
Someone you trust to protect me
and the interests of our clan.

28:49.584 --> 28:50.584
My dove.

28:51.709 --> 28:54.043
I forget you are a simple girl.

28:54.626 --> 28:56.418
You know nothing of the world.

28:57.418 --> 28:59.751
Perhaps I need a husband
who knows the toil of life

28:59.834 --> 29:01.293
and battle as you have.

29:02.168 --> 29:04.043
One who has seen the sty.

29:05.168 --> 29:06.126
Hmm.

29:06.876 --> 29:11.293
I do know of a fierce and undefeated
young samurai Seki told me of.

29:11.376 --> 29:13.418
Ah, but Seki exaggerates.

29:14.334 --> 29:17.001
"Best swordsman
in the best school," he said.

29:17.501 --> 29:20.293
Won 24 duels with every opponent dead.

29:21.084 --> 29:22.084
Not a noble family.

29:22.168 --> 29:27.126
A fisherman's son from Kohama,
but his rise reminds me of my own.

29:27.751 --> 29:29.543
What was his name again?

29:31.501 --> 29:33.668
Taigen, I believe.

29:33.751 --> 29:37.876
If his skills match his reputation,
he'll be offered a handsome salary.

29:37.959 --> 29:40.709
Perhaps, even at the castle here,

29:40.793 --> 29:42.918
-close to your father.
-[Akemi gasps]

29:43.834 --> 29:47.376
I only hope he's better than I am
at denying you sweets.

30:02.459 --> 30:05.209
[footsteps approaching]

30:05.293 --> 30:09.001
[Akemi giggles]

30:09.084 --> 30:12.584
-One, two, three.
-One, two, three.

30:12.668 --> 30:14.709
Gold? Wow. Uh.

30:15.376 --> 30:18.668
That's too much. I only brought candy.

30:19.418 --> 30:23.334
[Akemi giggles]
Have I defeated the undefeatable Taigen?

30:25.584 --> 30:28.584
Think of it as an engagement gift.

30:30.459 --> 30:31.751
He said yes?

30:33.334 --> 30:36.001
He's sure? You're sure?

30:37.959 --> 30:42.626
[sighs] The lord's daughter
marrying the son of a poor fisherman.

30:43.543 --> 30:47.543
[giggles] I'd marry you
if you were the son of a poor fish.

31:02.376 --> 31:04.084
[crows cawing]

31:08.209 --> 31:12.126
[suspenseful music accelerates]

31:22.084 --> 31:25.251
[sentry] No new students.
Find another school.

31:32.459 --> 31:33.543
I'm not a student.

31:33.626 --> 31:36.626
I bring a message
for the master of the Shindo Dojo.

31:41.293 --> 31:43.209
I must deliver it personally.

31:49.418 --> 31:51.584
[door opens]

31:56.043 --> 31:59.043
[tense music playing]

32:12.834 --> 32:15.918
[music continues]

32:39.209 --> 32:41.084
You may leave any message with me.

32:41.668 --> 32:44.793
[samurai] What must be said
must be said to the master directly.

32:45.584 --> 32:49.126
I assure you,
what is for the master is for me,

32:49.876 --> 32:54.084
as I assure you
the master does not meet with messengers.

32:56.584 --> 32:57.626
He will for me.

32:59.876 --> 33:02.501
You stand before the Shindo School.

33:03.876 --> 33:07.376
For 200 years,
we have taught here the Shindo-Ryu,

33:07.459 --> 33:10.251
secret methods
passed down from Priest Soto,

33:10.334 --> 33:14.918
taught to him on the peak of Mount Kurama
by the mystic Tengu themselves.

33:15.001 --> 33:17.084
Show your respect.

33:19.709 --> 33:21.543
I must insist.

33:24.126 --> 33:27.709
Escort him anywhere you please
that is far from here.

33:28.751 --> 33:30.584
Come on, blind beggar.

33:30.668 --> 33:34.084
You are bound by hospitality
to feed a traveler within your gates.

33:34.168 --> 33:36.543
I came very far. I'm very hungry.

33:37.209 --> 33:39.709
Or has the Shindo Dojo
done away with etiquette?

33:41.001 --> 33:41.959
Feed him.

33:42.751 --> 33:44.334
Then throw him out.

33:48.168 --> 33:49.168
[samurai 1] Eat.

33:51.584 --> 33:52.459
And leave.

33:52.543 --> 33:54.126
[all laughing]

34:00.293 --> 34:01.126
[sighs]

34:01.751 --> 34:03.668
[swishing]

34:15.126 --> 34:16.959
[efforts, grunts]

34:20.709 --> 34:22.209
Show me everything.

34:23.084 --> 34:27.459
To make the right sword, I must know
all that a samurai will do with it.

34:27.543 --> 34:29.334
All his techniques.

34:30.084 --> 34:32.918
But my Shindo-Ryu is secret.

34:33.584 --> 34:36.626
Every secret is revealed here.

34:42.876 --> 34:44.709
[grunts]

34:48.834 --> 34:52.293
[efforts, grunts]

35:01.293 --> 35:03.543
The sword is the soul of the samurai,

35:04.043 --> 35:06.459
and so it must match the man.

35:07.168 --> 35:09.418
His blade should be rigid and thin.

35:12.543 --> 35:13.626
And gaudy.

35:15.709 --> 35:17.709
We fold the steel to blend it.

35:19.293 --> 35:22.293
We beat the blend
to remove the impurities.

35:23.918 --> 35:25.584
The more pure the steel…

35:25.668 --> 35:26.501
[grunts]

35:26.584 --> 35:28.418
…the harder it is.

35:30.584 --> 35:33.168
But too pure, and it becomes brittle.

35:35.168 --> 35:36.001
[grunts]

35:36.084 --> 35:38.959
We must leave something
of how God made it.

35:40.918 --> 35:42.959
I thought we must beat out impurity.

35:43.043 --> 35:46.668
Yes, yet an impurity
in the right place is a quality.

35:47.251 --> 35:51.084
Soft steel in the center.
Hard steel for the edge.

35:53.918 --> 35:56.376
-[grunts]
-[clanking]

36:00.543 --> 36:01.959
These together…

36:02.043 --> 36:03.043
[grunts]

36:03.793 --> 36:05.626
…and there can be greatness.

36:17.084 --> 36:18.001
[The Swordmaker] Hmm.

36:24.793 --> 36:25.751
This is good.

36:26.626 --> 36:29.376
But it is not perfect.

36:31.293 --> 36:32.251
[sighs]

36:34.209 --> 36:35.334
What is a sword?

36:36.459 --> 36:38.543
The soul of a samurai.

36:39.084 --> 36:41.709
It is a line.

36:42.876 --> 36:44.876
On one side of the line is life.

36:46.043 --> 36:46.918
The other,

36:48.001 --> 36:48.876
death.

36:49.959 --> 36:53.709
The edge we forge
cuts the line between life and death.

36:54.668 --> 36:57.876
[clanking echoing off]

36:59.376 --> 37:00.668
Good enough for cooking.

37:02.043 --> 37:03.293
Kitchen knives.

37:03.376 --> 37:06.251
[chuckles] Make a thousand kitchen knives.

37:07.376 --> 37:10.084
Then you may be ready to make a sword.

37:12.501 --> 37:15.126
A smith signs his name.

37:15.209 --> 37:20.668
[theme music playing]

37:30.293 --> 37:34.626
[clanking]

37:35.418 --> 37:38.459
[grunts]

37:39.543 --> 37:42.959
All these years, how many fires?

37:43.543 --> 37:46.251
[grunts]

37:46.834 --> 37:50.001
[pants]

37:51.376 --> 37:52.376
No.

37:53.126 --> 37:55.626
No man can tame this cursed metal.

37:57.793 --> 38:00.001
Perhaps it does not want to be a sword.

38:00.084 --> 38:04.626
All metal wants to be a sword.

38:22.126 --> 38:23.959
Oof. [grunts]

38:25.376 --> 38:26.626
A sword?

38:27.459 --> 38:29.334
Are you stealing from me?

38:31.001 --> 38:32.459
I'm not stealing.

38:33.334 --> 38:35.918
I… am practicing.

38:37.001 --> 38:40.001
Why does a sword maker's apprentice
practice swordplay?

38:42.001 --> 38:44.251
[breathes deeply]

38:47.043 --> 38:49.043
Because I must become a great swordsman.

38:51.459 --> 38:53.584
I must become
the greatest swordsman alive.

38:54.459 --> 38:55.793
[chuckles] Is that all?

38:57.501 --> 39:00.543
And why must you become such a swordsman?

39:01.251 --> 39:02.751
[sighs]

39:04.876 --> 39:05.709
Forgive me.

39:07.293 --> 39:08.793
I've kept from you a secret.

39:10.043 --> 39:13.001
One everyone else knows
as plain as my face, but you do not.

39:15.543 --> 39:16.751
I know you're ugly.

39:18.043 --> 39:19.293
What is ugly to me?

39:20.126 --> 39:21.168
You are blind

39:21.834 --> 39:24.293
and so cannot see the shame of my face.

39:25.709 --> 39:26.543
I am…

39:27.668 --> 39:29.834
made of mixed metal.

39:32.001 --> 39:34.709
No amount of hammering
can remove my impurity.

39:38.668 --> 39:41.959
At the time I was born,
there were four white men in all of Japan.

39:43.418 --> 39:46.459
Men who traded in
weapons and opium and flesh.

39:46.543 --> 39:50.251
[evil music playing]

39:51.043 --> 39:53.751
One of them took my mother

39:54.959 --> 39:56.084
and made of me…

40:01.501 --> 40:02.543
a monster.

40:04.793 --> 40:06.168
A creature of shame.

40:08.251 --> 40:09.709
I do not know their names.

40:11.751 --> 40:13.084
I do know their fate.

40:14.543 --> 40:17.501
They will all die by my hand.
I have vowed this.

40:23.251 --> 40:25.376
What have I taught you about steel?

40:27.126 --> 40:29.293
The strongest sword is a blend of steel.

40:30.584 --> 40:31.668
Soft and hard.

40:32.418 --> 40:34.084
Pure and impure.

40:35.251 --> 40:36.793
You may be something shameful.

40:38.209 --> 40:39.376
You may also be strong.

40:43.501 --> 40:45.084
You may train at nights.

40:47.168 --> 40:51.668
["Battle Without Honor or Humanity"
by Tomoyasu Hotei playing]

40:55.251 --> 40:56.084
[grunts]

41:26.418 --> 41:30.001
[song continues]

41:43.959 --> 41:45.084
[song ends]

41:53.376 --> 41:54.209
Hey.

41:54.751 --> 41:56.668
Come on, beggar boy. Move it.

41:57.251 --> 42:00.626
[samurai] This will be much simpler
if you allow me to speak with your master.

42:00.709 --> 42:02.543
No one sees the master.

42:04.501 --> 42:06.584
[grunts, efforts]

42:07.751 --> 42:11.459
I cannot leave here
until I speak to the master of this dojo.

42:12.084 --> 42:13.251
[grunts]

42:14.668 --> 42:15.584
Oh, good.

42:18.209 --> 42:19.543
We get to kill you.

42:25.668 --> 42:26.626
[grunts]

42:28.126 --> 42:29.293
-Argh!
-[groans]

42:29.376 --> 42:33.126
[tense music accelerates, fades]

42:34.584 --> 42:36.043
How dare you?

42:36.126 --> 42:39.126
Be warned. You face my Shindo-Ryu.

42:39.626 --> 42:41.293
The problem with Shindo-Ryu is

42:41.918 --> 42:43.001
it's trash.

42:43.084 --> 42:45.084
[suspenseful music playing]

42:48.251 --> 42:49.168
Hyah!

42:52.459 --> 42:53.543
[grunts]

42:56.084 --> 42:59.126
[chuckles] A poor technique.

43:00.584 --> 43:01.668
Easily learned.

43:03.168 --> 43:04.293
Easily defeated.

43:07.001 --> 43:07.876
Ugh!

43:11.209 --> 43:12.418
[wails]

43:14.084 --> 43:15.751
The Swallow's Return crumbles

43:15.834 --> 43:18.584
against the Fisherman's Net
of the Rogen-Ryu.

43:18.668 --> 43:19.501
[grunts]

43:20.793 --> 43:23.168
-Hyah! Hyah!
-[grunts]

43:25.084 --> 43:26.209
[wails]

43:27.001 --> 43:28.251
[grunts]

43:32.334 --> 43:34.334
[grunts, muffled grunts]

43:34.418 --> 43:35.543
[grunts]

43:35.626 --> 43:37.543
[wails]

43:43.668 --> 43:45.251
[groans]

43:46.709 --> 43:48.876
Then you fight with Rogen-Ryu?

43:49.709 --> 43:50.543
No.

43:51.501 --> 43:52.501
It is also trash.

43:53.001 --> 43:55.376
What school are you?

43:55.459 --> 43:56.793
Your name and teacher!

43:56.876 --> 43:58.168
Announce yourself!

43:58.668 --> 44:01.793
[grunting]

44:07.584 --> 44:09.918
[groans]

44:15.293 --> 44:16.459
Hyah!

44:17.168 --> 44:18.543
[groans]

44:21.834 --> 44:23.126
[yells]

44:29.334 --> 44:32.876
[grunts, groans]

44:39.459 --> 44:42.459
You defeat children and take a bow?

44:46.084 --> 44:49.126
Do I duel the mystic Tengu themselves?

44:49.209 --> 44:52.751
Put down that toy and draw your sword!

44:52.834 --> 44:55.543
But… then you'll die.

44:56.209 --> 44:57.793
-[tense music accelerates]
-[grunts]

44:57.876 --> 45:00.834
-[samurai 1] To Taigen! [laughs]
-[samurai 2] To Taigen! [laughs]

45:00.918 --> 45:02.376
The lord's daughter.

45:02.459 --> 45:05.293
-His beautiful daughter. Not even ugly.
-[laughing]

45:05.376 --> 45:08.293
And head of castle security
with 5,000 koku.

45:08.376 --> 45:09.543
Who would have thought?

45:09.626 --> 45:11.959
[chuckles] Me.

45:12.793 --> 45:14.626
Taigen, come quick!

45:15.209 --> 45:16.418
We have a problem.

45:17.751 --> 45:21.543
[ominous music playing]

45:22.834 --> 45:27.709
[grunting, groaning]

45:35.418 --> 45:39.209
-Who dares challenge the Shindo Dojo?
-[grunts]

45:39.293 --> 45:42.126
I'm afraid no one in this dojo
has offered much of a ch--

45:42.209 --> 45:43.334
[grunts]

45:46.293 --> 45:52.959
[music swelling]

45:55.251 --> 45:57.126
[thunder rumbling]

45:59.168 --> 46:01.209
You're from Kohama Village.

46:02.459 --> 46:03.501
Do I know you?

46:05.043 --> 46:06.668
You've climbed some heights

46:07.751 --> 46:09.751
to be the prize of a miserable lot.

46:10.251 --> 46:13.918
Taigen has won 24 duels.
How many have you won?

46:16.751 --> 46:18.084
Should I have been counting?

46:19.376 --> 46:22.459
Kill the son of a bitch, Taigen.
Teach him to respect Shindo.

46:22.543 --> 46:27.376
I've come to speak with your master
and will go on my way once I have.

46:28.751 --> 46:31.459
You won't go anywhere
except in the funeral cart.

46:37.126 --> 46:39.626
[both grunting]

46:49.043 --> 46:51.043
[Taigen growls]

46:51.126 --> 46:52.168
[samurai growls]

46:54.043 --> 46:54.959
[Taigen groans]

46:56.334 --> 46:58.293
[both grunting]

47:11.918 --> 47:13.918
[samurai grunts]

47:14.626 --> 47:15.584
[chuckles]

47:16.459 --> 47:19.126
With a naked blade, you'd be dead.

47:21.918 --> 47:23.501
[thunder rumbling]

47:24.251 --> 47:25.084
[gasps]

47:26.793 --> 47:28.418
You had a name for me.

47:31.001 --> 47:37.043
Taigen. You cannot allow that
to dishonor us or you.

47:37.793 --> 47:38.668
Kill him!

47:44.209 --> 47:46.209
[wind rustling]

47:51.626 --> 47:54.126
[tense music playing]

47:59.626 --> 48:01.959
Are you afraid to fight with steel?

48:02.959 --> 48:03.959
Thank you.

48:04.459 --> 48:06.459
No one has yet deserved my blade.

48:07.959 --> 48:10.876
[sword chiming]

48:19.668 --> 48:21.751
You have a blade by Master Eiji?

48:31.834 --> 48:35.834
[tense music accelerates]

48:55.751 --> 48:57.209
[music fades]

49:01.126 --> 49:05.751
[dramatic music swelling]

49:09.168 --> 49:12.793
[music crescendos, ends]

49:16.834 --> 49:22.126
[soft, tense music playing]

49:24.376 --> 49:26.584
[music accelerates]

49:31.001 --> 49:32.168
[swords clanging]

49:38.293 --> 49:40.376
-[both grunting]
-[swords clanging]

49:41.501 --> 49:43.709
[samurai grunts]

49:50.418 --> 49:52.543
Death comes for everyone.

49:53.501 --> 49:54.459
For you,

49:55.959 --> 49:56.834
today.

49:58.334 --> 50:01.584
[suspenseful music playing]

50:01.668 --> 50:02.876
[grunts, groans]

50:18.709 --> 50:24.251
[theme music playing]

50:26.293 --> 50:30.751
[metal clanking]

50:33.043 --> 50:37.334
[suspenseful music accelerates]

50:46.043 --> 50:47.209
[swords clanging]

50:48.251 --> 50:51.251
[Taigen groans, grunts]

50:54.543 --> 50:56.751
[grunts]

50:57.543 --> 50:58.501
[Dojo master] Stop!

50:59.459 --> 51:01.126
[breathes heavily]

51:04.043 --> 51:06.126
[sighs]

51:09.751 --> 51:13.001
[pants] You are the master of this school?

51:14.834 --> 51:15.668
Hmm.

51:18.626 --> 51:20.709
Your students need better training.

51:22.168 --> 51:24.209
You have a message for me.

51:26.543 --> 51:27.626
[samurai] A question.

51:29.918 --> 51:34.876
Where may I find your brother,
the black market merchant Heiji Shindo?

51:36.918 --> 51:40.751
You did all this to find my brother?

51:41.418 --> 51:42.418
Why?

51:46.793 --> 51:49.834
Heiji Shindo is in the fortress
on Tanabe Island,

51:49.918 --> 51:51.668
protected by the Genken Clan.

51:52.501 --> 51:54.501
Whatever business you have with him,

51:55.084 --> 51:57.001
you will never reach him.

52:07.459 --> 52:11.209
[groans] You're still a dog.

52:11.293 --> 52:14.168
[tense music accelerates]

52:16.793 --> 52:18.459
-[sword swishing]
-[Taigen groans]

52:26.084 --> 52:27.959
[crow cawing]

53:01.626 --> 53:03.543
Thank you for my ember.

53:05.126 --> 53:09.043
[theme music playing]

53:10.501 --> 53:11.334
[groans]

53:12.084 --> 53:13.918
[chirping]

53:45.334 --> 53:46.793
[sighs]

53:51.001 --> 53:54.376
[groans, screams]

54:06.668 --> 54:09.751
[Dojo master] Forgive me
for giving your location, my brother.

54:10.293 --> 54:13.168
He was unstoppable.

54:14.501 --> 54:16.709
He defeated my every student.

54:17.209 --> 54:20.543
Hmm. Your students need better training.

54:20.626 --> 54:24.209
The samurai, he's not human.

54:24.793 --> 54:26.418
I saw its eyes.

54:37.793 --> 54:39.626
[man] The Four Fangs.

54:42.793 --> 54:46.376
Send the Four Fangs after this samurai.

54:48.251 --> 54:50.209
Double their price and be done with it.

54:51.209 --> 54:54.251
[high-tempo music playing]

54:54.334 --> 54:56.334
[snorting]

55:01.209 --> 55:02.209
[music ends]

55:19.709 --> 55:22.209
It is time for me to begin my quest.

55:24.251 --> 55:27.709
Revenge is like gold. It does not rust.

55:28.376 --> 55:29.459
It will wait.

55:30.959 --> 55:31.959
I am ready.

55:32.543 --> 55:34.251
You will get yourself killed.

55:34.334 --> 55:35.543
I am ready.

55:37.334 --> 55:38.251
I am.

55:43.376 --> 55:45.334
I can never repay your kindness.

55:47.709 --> 55:50.168
When I told you my shame,
you did not disown me,

55:51.668 --> 55:53.876
even though I'm hideous to men's eyes.

55:55.251 --> 55:57.168
I have no eyes, so…

55:58.793 --> 56:00.251
I can accept you.

56:02.668 --> 56:04.334
I will always be grateful to you,

56:05.918 --> 56:07.001
Swordfather.

56:19.959 --> 56:23.543
[horses snorting]

56:27.626 --> 56:29.584
Before I leave, Swordfather…

56:32.001 --> 56:33.709
there's something more I must confess.

56:33.793 --> 56:36.251
You have spoken enough nonsense today.

56:36.334 --> 56:38.168
We cannot part in a lie.

56:38.251 --> 56:40.084
That is your burden to keep.

56:40.168 --> 56:42.793
-I have made your swords unclean.
-[The Swordmaker] Quiet!

56:44.251 --> 56:46.959
You came to me as a stupid lost boy.

56:48.584 --> 56:52.209
If you insist on leaving now,
it will be as a stupid lost man.

57:07.751 --> 57:09.001
If you must do this,

57:10.251 --> 57:11.501
take a sword.

57:13.793 --> 57:17.209
I already have one, Swordfather.

57:19.501 --> 57:21.001
[swishing]

57:24.418 --> 57:26.501
[clanking, chiming]

57:39.459 --> 57:42.834
[sinister music swelling]

57:42.918 --> 57:44.168
[footsteps approaching]

57:47.418 --> 57:48.709
-[swishing]
-Ah!

57:50.543 --> 57:52.668
[breathes heavily]

57:55.459 --> 57:56.293
Peaches.

57:57.709 --> 57:59.418
[music ends]

58:05.334 --> 58:07.626
[samurai] This season,
on Blue Eye Samurai…

58:07.709 --> 58:10.043
[Fang leader]
You have enemies now. Rich ones.

58:10.126 --> 58:11.376
[action music playing]

58:11.459 --> 58:13.376
All Kyoto is talking about

58:13.459 --> 58:16.334
the unnamed Samurai
who cut through Shindo Dojo.

58:17.709 --> 58:20.334
[samurai] You will not find
what you seek at my side.

58:20.418 --> 58:23.376
I know why you don't want me around,
but you can trust me.

58:23.459 --> 58:26.084
I'd never, ever, ever, ever tell anyone
that you're a g--

58:27.251 --> 58:30.209
If I see you again, I will kill you.

58:30.293 --> 58:31.793
The cut is so clean.

58:33.334 --> 58:34.918
It's not so bad. We'll be married.

58:35.001 --> 58:37.543
[Taigen] Your father
will never allow it now.

58:37.626 --> 58:39.834
It wasn't even a duel.
Therefore, you never lost.

58:40.459 --> 58:42.126
He must have left a trail.

58:44.376 --> 58:47.001
You cost me my station and my honor.

58:47.084 --> 58:49.501
I'll have it all back
when I return with your corpse.

58:49.584 --> 58:51.543
[Akemi] I've been a captive my whole life.

58:51.626 --> 58:54.251
I won't be locked away
married to a stranger.

58:54.334 --> 58:56.209
I just have to find Taigen.

58:56.751 --> 58:58.668
I always dreamt of greatness.

58:58.751 --> 58:59.793
Ahh!

58:59.876 --> 59:01.626
[Taigen] You think you can be great?

59:03.626 --> 59:06.584
[Ringo] I've actually seen
what greatness looks like.

59:08.043 --> 59:10.084
[samurai] You don't want revenge.

59:10.709 --> 59:12.501
Revenge does not hesitate.

59:13.584 --> 59:15.626
There's something I need to tell you.

59:15.709 --> 59:18.084
[Shindo] Fowler's castle is impenetrable.

59:18.168 --> 59:19.876
Some problems you can't kill.

59:19.959 --> 59:21.251
An offer?

59:21.751 --> 59:23.501
You have murder in your eyes.

59:24.168 --> 59:25.459
He deserves to die.

59:26.209 --> 59:29.001
[Fowler] Ten years
I've waited for this moment.

59:29.668 --> 59:31.376
Your guns will be ready?

59:31.459 --> 59:33.251
They are all ready.

59:35.168 --> 59:37.918
I want to see all of you. Show me.

59:38.001 --> 59:39.459
Don't hold back.

59:40.751 --> 59:41.959
I'm on the path of revenge.

59:42.043 --> 59:45.043
There's no place on it
for love or friendship.

59:45.126 --> 59:47.334
I have no interest in money or power.

59:48.043 --> 59:49.918
I have no interest in being happy.

59:52.501 --> 59:54.001
Only satisfied.

59:57.334 --> 59:59.043
[music fades]

59:59.126 --> 01:00:01.126
[closing theme music playing]
